# Hybrid prefill split: grouped-GEMM for resident experts, host tier for
# non-resident — the fix for the static-partition-prefill campaign.
#
# Campaign: docs/campaigns/static-partition-prefill.md
# Design:   docs/design-static-partition-prefill.md
# Gate:     tier-ON prefill within 25 % of tier OFF at the reference cell,
#           decode still at the record, §3.4 continuation-restore and E2
#           checks passing.
#
# The defect (DESIGN §7.0.2ai, measured): under a static half-partition
# every MoE layer's routed batch contains at least one non-resident expert.
# The grouped-GEMM callers (on_before_prefill, build_grouped_mask_otd) call
# try_acquire_simultaneous without a cpu_tier_misses destination, so the
# static-partition branch returns nullopt on the first non-resident entry.
# The entire layer falls back to exec_prefill_onednn's per-expert loop —
# ~5,520 kernel launches vs ~120 for the grouped path.
#
# The fix: wire cpu_tier_misses into both grouped-GEMM callers. Non-resident
# entries get a sentinel slot ID (num_expert, one past the last valid slot)
# in the batch_mem_ptr remap. The mask-gen kernels (GPU and CPU) naturally
# exclude the sentinel; scatter_reduce's UINT_MAX-based skip handles it.
# After the grouped-GEMM completes, exec_prefill_onednn runs in host-only
# mode for the non-resident subset: same gather → host compute → index_add
# path as the per-expert fallback (patch 0018, bug #2 fix), but only for
# experts that on_load_expert_weights returns kHostTier.
#
# Applied against the pinned runtime, build 2026.4.0-22849-71640275d29, on
# top of patches/0003-0036.
#
# What changes:
#   moe_3gemm_swiglu_opt.cpp    on_before_prefill, build_grouped_mask_otd:
#                                pass cpu_tier_misses when static partition
#                                active; sentinel in slot remap.
#                                get_expert_mask_from_gpu: skip sentinel
#                                entries instead of throwing.
#                                exec_prefill_onednn: host_only parameter
#                                skips device-resident experts.
#                                exec_prefill_micro_gemm,
#                                exec_prefill_grouped_gemm: post-GEMM host
#                                dispatch for non-resident misses.
#   moe_otd_perf.hpp            New counter: hybrid_prefill_layers.
#   moe_otd_runtime.cpp         Print hybrid_prefill_layers in dump().
#   moe_3gemm_gpu_test.cpp      Red-first test: get_expert_mask_from_gpu
#                                skips sentinel entries instead of throwing.
#                                Perf counter: hybrid_prefill_layers exists
#                                and defaults to 0.
#

